== Popular dishes ==

* [[W:Pinchitos|Pinxitos]], from [[Baliscano]] ''pinix'' "skewer", consista  of small cubes of meat threaded onto a skewer which are traditionally cooked over charcoal braziers. The meat is typically chicken or pork, but variations using beef or lamb exist.

